+    - [Copy YDLIDAR SDK to your project](#copy-ydlidar-sdk-to-your-project)
+    - [Add YDLIDAR SDK project to the CMakeLists file of your project](#add-ydlidar-sdk-project-to-the-cmakelists-file-of-your-project)
