"></span><span class="mord mathdefault">L</span><span class="mord mathdefault" style="margin-right:0.05764em;">S</span><span class="mord mathdefault" style="margin-right:0.10903em;">N</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222222222222222em;"></span><span class="mbin">&#x2212;</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222222222222222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span>, can be obtained sequentially.</p>
